+
+**Language/Version**: Undetermined; no application source exists in the workspace.
+**Primary Dependencies**: A transactional relational persistence layer and the existing reminder-provider adapter, both to be identified during implementation.
+**Storage**: Durable relational persistence assumed for atomic conditional updates and unique constraints.
+**Testing**: Undetermined; tests must exercise the real transaction mechanism, not only mocks.
+**Target Platform**: Backend reminder-dispatch and provider-callback path.
+**Project Type**: Backend service slice; the workspace contains planning artifacts only.
+**Performance Goals**: No numeric target is specified; correctness under concurrent attempts is mandatory.
+**Constraints**: Balance must remain non-negative; every terminal outcome must be idempotent; failures, timeouts, and cancellations must restore exactly one credit.
+**Scale/Scope**: One workspace-scoped quota and one durable reservation per logical reminder send attempt.
