+| Performance Target | Technique | Existing Infrastructure | Validation | Tasks |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| No negative balance under concurrent reserves | Conditional atomic debit plus transaction serialization | Not present in workspace | Concurrent integration test | Assigned by `/story-tasks` |
+| Bounded duplicate processing | Unique attempt key and terminal-state guard | Not present in workspace | Repeat and race tests | Assigned by `/story-tasks` |
