+- [ ] Bind quota operations to the authenticated workspace context at the existing service boundary.
+- [ ] Keep provider callback authenticity checks in the established provider adapter; do not treat caller-supplied outcome data as trusted.
+- [ ] Restrict direct quota mutation to the transactional reservation service.
